cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated paper as below."
title: "Can Mamba match LSTM for daily streamflow prediction? A parameter- and depth-matched benchmark on 671 CAMELS basins"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation for a capacity-matched benchmark of a Mamba-3
  Static-Dynamic Adapter against a CuDNN LSTM for daily rainfall-runoff
  simulation on 671 CAMELS basins. Includes the training and evaluation
  pipeline, a cluster-level blocked permutation test, and the figure and
  table generation code for the manuscript.
type: software
authors:
